{
  "_id": "28NgMpMQkmTy4uyFhPj8z4XVqml",
  "_type": "Docs",
  "_index": "a6",
  "title": "Deploying",
  "navigationTitle": "",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Once you're ready to deploy to production it's time to hook up Alinea to a backend. The Alinea handler needs access to a backend service that can authenticate users, store drafts and publish changes back to the git repository."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Update your "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "CMS config",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "2YlC927lwX5hfm2G9JHx9j3yRux",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "259Ey7LXgqL7ZDGJ8XK1vBJmZrh"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": " to inform Alinea where the handler lives and on which path the admin dashboard is served."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "CodeBlock",
      "_id": "2YlDwmJLzaL93bp5gYZmshbJG1P",
      "code": "export const cms = createCMS({\n  // ...\n  handlerUrl: '/api/cms',\n  adminPath: '/admin'\n})",
      "fileName": "",
      "language": "",
      "compact": false
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "While building your project (`alinea build`), the dashboard is generated in your public folder: an `admin.html` file and an `admin` folder with its assets, named after the `adminPath` defined within your "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "CMS config",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "2eM1iHgXBo49fVD4NaBDbLI7XpI",
              "_entry": "259Ey7LXgqL7ZDGJ8XK1vBJmZrh",
              "_link": "entry"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": ". Exclude them from git by adding them to your `.gitignore` file:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "CodeBlock",
      "_id": "2eM0q5z6cky9xrlPsHoH5ltj1A6",
      "code": "/public/admin*",
      "fileName": ".gitignore",
      "language": ""
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Make sure your Next.js config is wrapped with `withAlinea` from `alinea/next`, which serves the generated dashboard on `/admin`. Deploy your code and follow the instructions on `/admin` to configure your backend."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
